# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Architecture

## AI Execution Layer
This repository is operated through Ralph as an AI execution layer.
Ralph coordinates task selection, prompt assembly, code execution, review,
state updates, and human escalation.

## Main Components
- `ralph.sh` — orchestrator loop
- `scripts/ralph_bot.py` — Telegram control plane
- `tasks.json` — structured backlog and execution metadata
- `progress.md` — human-readable history of completed work
- `.ralph/memory/` — persistent project memory

## Expected Flow
1. Pick next pending task
2. Build context for the coding agent
3. Run the coding agent
4. Run tests and collect diff
5. Run review agent or human checkpoint
6. Persist status, progress, and memory

